      "writtenOn": "2024-03-07T19:20:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If it\u0027s not too late to change this interface, it seems a little safer to have one API function that returns the count and has the caps as an output param. That would avoid the possibility of a race on the caller side, and it would make it more obvious to the caller that they need to check the count.",
      "revId": "c3d5f2120bd29e1c53caf72ceaa5ed5651faf37d",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
