      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-03-12T15:21:06Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I agree, but that change might need to wait until we remove the shim, because the EC API is ```const uint32_t *const pd_get_snk_caps(int port)``` and ```uint8_t pd_get_snk_cap_cnt(int port)```.",
      "parentUuid": "408dc180_cc27186e",
      "revId": "c3d5f2120bd29e1c53caf72ceaa5ed5651faf37d",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
